WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Priya>So let me walk you through how invoices get approved today.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Priya>A supplier invoice lands in the AP inbox, and someone on my team, um, enters it into the ERP.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Priya>Then we match it against the purchase order. If it doesn't match, we send it back to the supplier.

4
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:27.000
<v Marco>And if it matches, anything over five thousand dollars comes to me in finance for approval.

5
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.000
<v Priya>Right, and under five thousand AP just approves it directly.

6
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Marco>Once it's approved either way, the payment run picks it up on Friday and pays the supplier.
